tment/Shop/Plot, iii) Carpet Area of Apartment/Shop/Plot(sqr mtrs), iv) Exclusive open Terrace area of each unit(sqr mtrs)if any, v) Area of the Exclusive Balcony or Verandah of each unit (sqr mtrs) if any, vi) Number of Apartment/Shop/Plot available for Sale, vii) Number of Such Apartment/Shop/Plot already sold',128,1,'sysadmin','2008-02-18 13:08:00.000','sysadmin','2008-02-18 13:08:00.000');
